skill 1
players 4
monsters# each player's forwardmove sidemove turn buttons, | between them [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
damage -80 0 100
damage -80 -80 100 p2
damage 0 -80 100 p3
damage 80 0 100 p4
damage 0 80 100
